The user can only watch one episode at a time.
The user will watch the episodes in order.
There are no "special" episodes.
The user is currently on episode 4.
Implementation:
int episode = 1; // the episode number to watch next
if (episode == 1) {
episode = 2;
} else if (episode == 2) {
episode = 3;
} else if (episode == 3) {
episode = 4;
} else if (episode == 4) {
episode = 5;
} else {
episode = 1;
}
return episode;
